/users/claincly/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claincly/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"event":"assigned","commit_id":null,"commit_url":null,"created_at":"2021-06-08T08:45:59Z","assignee":{"login":"claincly","id":84200018,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg0MjAwMDE4","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/84200018?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/claincly","html_url":"https://github.com/claincly","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claincly/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claincly/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claincly/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claincly/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claincly/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claincly/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claincly/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claincly/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claincly/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"performed_via_github_app":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/google/ExoPlayer/issues/comments/856589765","html_url":"https://github.com/google/ExoPlayer/issues/9024#issuecomment-856589765","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/google/ExoPlayer/issues/9024","id":856589765,"node_id":"MDEyOklzc3VlQ29tbWVudDg1NjU4OTc2NQ==","user":{"login":"JuzTosS","id":1567219,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE1NjcyMTk=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1567219?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/JuzTosS","html_url":"https://github.com/JuzTosS","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JuzTosS/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JuzTosS/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JuzTosS/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JuzTosS/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JuzTosS/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JuzTosS/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JuzTosS/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JuzTosS/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JuzTosS/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2021-06-08T08:56:09Z","updated_at":"2021-06-08T08:57:27Z","body":"If you try to call the constructor with default style `PlayerView(context, attrs, defStyleAttr)` it won't be applied as it's not passed further when retrieving values. \r\n\r\nI personally need it for the case to extend PlayerView and have a view that sets TextureView by default instead of SurfaceView. To solve this I can pass a style `defStyleAttr` with texture view as `surface_type=2`\r\n\r\nSo the fixed line will look like this:\r\n`TypedArray a = context.getTheme().obtainStyledAttributes(attrs, R.styleable.PlayerView, defStyleAttr, 0);` \r\n\r\nThere's also one missed override with `defStyleRes`\r\n`public FrameLayout(@NonNull Context context, @Nullable AttributeSet attrs,\r\n            @AttrRes int defStyleAttr, @StyleRes int defStyleRes) {`\r\n\r\nThat also should be used with obtainStyledAttributes, we again should pass defStyleRes instead of 0 to the last parameter.\r\n           \r\nSo the fixed line will look like this:\r\n`TypedArray a = context.getTheme().obtainStyledAttributes(attrs, R.styleable.PlayerView, defStyleAttr, defStyleRes);` ","author_association":"NONE","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/google/ExoPlayer/issues/comments/856589765/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"event":"commented","actor":{"login":"JuzTosS","id":1567219,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE1NjcyMTk=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.git